sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Kafka as Kafka<br/>order.confirmed
  participant Kitchen as Kitchen<br/>KDS consumer
  participant Projection as Kitchen<br/>KDS projection
  participant Redis as Redis<br/>KDS runtime state
  participant Pub as Kitchen<br/>queue change notifier
  participant BFF as BFF<br/>Realtime edge
  participant UI as KDS UI<br/>Kitchen/Bar
  actor Chef as Chef
  participant Order as Order<br/>item readiness

  Kafka->>Kitchen: Deliver order.confirmed
  Kitchen->>Kitchen: Validate event contract
  Kitchen->>Projection: Create station tickets from confirmed order
  Projection->>Redis: Store tickets, queue state and revision
  Projection-->>Kitchen: Queue changed events
  Kitchen->>Pub: Notify queue changes
  Pub->>Redis: Publish internal change hint
  Redis-->>BFF: Redis pub/sub event
  BFF-->>UI: WebSocket hint kds.queue_changed
  UI->>BFF: Refetch GET /kds/queue
  BFF->>Kitchen: TCP get queue snapshot
  Kitchen->>Projection: Read station queue snapshot
  Projection->>Redis: Read operational queue state
  Kitchen-->>BFF: Queue snapshot
  BFF-->>UI: Authoritative queue data

  Chef->>UI: Start ticket
  UI->>BFF: POST start ticket
  BFF->>Kitchen: TCP start ticket
  Kitchen->>Projection: Start ticket
  Projection->>Redis: Move ticket to PROCESSING
  Kitchen->>Pub: Notify ticket started
  Pub->>Redis: Publish queue changed hint
  Redis-->>BFF: Queue changed hint
  BFF-->>UI: WebSocket hint, UI refetches

  Chef->>UI: Mark ticket ready
  UI->>BFF: POST mark ready
  BFF->>Kitchen: TCP mark ready
  Kitchen->>Projection: Mark ticket ready
  Projection->>Redis: Move ticket to READY
  Kitchen->>Order: Notify item readiness
  Order->>Order: Update item READY, if all items ready then order READY
  Order-->>Kitchen: Item readiness acknowledged
  Kitchen->>Pub: Notify ticket ready
  Pub->>Redis: Publish queue changed hint
  Redis-->>BFF: Queue changed hint
  BFF-->>UI: WebSocket hint, UI refetches

  Note over UI,BFF: WebSocket hints that the queue changed and UI refetches authoritative state
